;敌对行动已将沙特石油产量推至&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/1dyysQxLrCh0keG1LzJ3iFEgD9pAzMwVdX-TLKThR4UBXVkkFc6Ix-GVO6Emh450HXER3yzhMa1RIzX6aXRXase1E4IEn9h_vfWogkOqtu0AbAf4n5rUhYIR2PW4n6YvriqdM0oCQhgxeJFXCC-o6ByDZEdaR8TOo9PMuWscpWiXjd-xYvWgL0dfF6FblIg2vl4SZ1dgvjO_9JbyUmsMOSJshYxAmF7MZO0KrdVivM3z57PxACkQ5h6j5bojfC5zv1eoQXOo93ZGUvxI4hqh5hnqbJMJCII9tmsLEgYrdcEYuR0Ri2op2E8KH3KpJmxUqqgwY8MHkkajrRNUM30LCwKXHawKEXfMlEuuwNI2uyxFt6YdqW7ZlCndz420S0S8SwOlnv8ik17TNxZ0I4oW2Yfo7HZkU5qUJbKKMWI4rXa1BEZ2R5BcgFO9ghKSXTWw_GREM0qll4BR1a9wh1bLHL-QhYsfy9QUpz5xgvy6X22VvQTyyXzZzVZ7QVHCawdLWLJvHlZVkqxJeBXSbMer41_rQCUOiw/RKlFJY41DMe_59EcZaItD9BnjlgGLPbF/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="沙特告诉 OPEC，产量再次下滑至 1990 年以来的最低水平"&gt;数十年来的最低水平&lt;/a&gt;。现在，他们威胁要使&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/2WJN9Zt6CH9lLgYtpLS49S2Y1E0D8j3LUdgfYPd7IC878BN-vzhUSNdBxMQc1qqbwuxPzPdOp6ht9Sl6B74_VfayNAzL5DK_kKNAFYEPSyMYtCmQ5qpmYwD3Bhw2gHIL7SsKyhyQfRoU7wBb50YKWh71__F4cJynxDZrwH1Edv00yeQBUGcyES355DPcEXEcmAih6djTBzPktlsn7wE2QY5Naduhs6RarvsWyo3D5zp17mow1PItviRN-wc7us2QO1CdEvb-IKr5rUirEHcprd-EjeSasvaMwNYCHpDLTUmpJoGuYeDSTBEBBUITqwWpd6hA5mgnIDElwNEnBZCm1HIAIHrgqddfC9nrAFeY_RBClfxTii3G_JJ74L0d0YMAnhbnVUOUZMvYr18CyVF7XosUit-KQ00OvXw2U4iGjPrpc4kodwHUkuSKFTRQgeegf6MuSr_QxtnWPL1VOCGoUTsnKpI_lhK3l_6SnXcAk5M1iJyKh8hoVPMwFqvLvW8xaY2HSE9hGnAthT6d8_nUuDKPN6TxOzaOqQlqTQ/yafOSMzFlrGgQhdM9OP0vOgY4aW2J0jA/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="穆罕默德·本·萨勒曼和沙特阿拉伯面临关键石油管道关闭数周的危机"&gt;沙特数万亿美元的经济多元化计划变得复杂&lt;/a&gt;，而且就在几周前，利雅得将举行旗舰投资会议，摩根大通首席执行官杰米戴蒙和高盛首席执行官大卫所罗门将出席。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr style="border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 24px;" /&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;据报道，&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;特朗普 2 月份决定&lt;/strong&gt;加入以色列对伊朗开战，导致伊朗和黎巴嫩近 8,000 人死亡，中东其他地区死亡人数更多。国会的一项新研究发现，这还&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/hKbGbOugyvuJjJoaVpPcEainKg8GUltWztS9MZDcot9j47V